:question/worked-solution "Remember that the equation of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the horizontal radius has length $a=\\frac{7}{2}$ and the vertical radius has length $b=2.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{3.5}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{{\\left(\\frac{7}{2}\\right)}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{{7}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}\\right)}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\left(\\frac{49}{4}\\right)}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{4{x}^{2}}{49}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088324 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "17dbb695-a8da-50c8-bbc0-8305a0e101a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342448} {:answer/id #uuid "2fb68ca0-59ba-5dad-94a0-0b73ef26ecfc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342636} {:answer/id #uuid "99b15d26-b6be-5ef3-a9cf-fd12150a374e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343589} {:answer/id #uuid "a9d29486-cbd3-56cc-baa6-eb5af1fe093e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{16}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343737} {:answer/id #uuid "bb629a7c-214b-5b78-9be1-51f1b708557d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343886}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2fb68ca0-59ba-5dad-94a0-0b73ef26ecfc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/valu